  <meta data-rh="true" http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"/><meta data-rh="true" http-equiv="Content-Language" content="en-AU"/><meta data-rh="true" name="description" content="PCYC Hornsby-Ku-Ring-Gai is the community’s largest indoor sporting precinct, and has been a part of the local community since 1968. PCYC Hornsby-Ku-Ring-Gai is proud to boast an amazing purpose-built facility consisting of a new health gym and boxing gym, multipurpose sports courts, world class gymnastics set up, café and a range of multipurpose rooms. We are a modern, safe and exciting club delivering our mission to get our community active in life.

Our Boxing Room is professionally equipped - yes, the Ring is included! Your booking allows you full access to the space and its&#x27; amenities.

Whether you&#x27;re a community group, or simply members of the local community, we here at PCYC Hornsby-Ku-Ring-Gai welcome you! Need a space for a friendly, or looking for rainy day activities? Children&#x27;s birthday party and not sure about the weather? Teambuilding? Reach out!

Equipment is provided and Activity Supervisor available on request - unless of course YOU are the supervisor looking for the perfect space to host your own classes! 

Our facilities support numerous sports &amp; recreation programs, school holiday programs, police run community programs and now you, too, can book space for your events and occasions.

Whatever your requirements, we here at PCYC Hornsby-Ku-Ring-Gai have the space for you! Film and TV enquiries welcome.

